<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109649" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπτι-όω</span></b> , only in 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be turned on
				one's back,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπτιωθέντος [τοῦ βρέφους]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.100
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				106
			</span></i>; to be <i>turned downside up, to be upset,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπτιοῦτο σκάφη νεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					418
				</span></i>
			; of leaves, <i>to be laid back,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.88
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of land,
				<i>slope gently upwards,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόφος . . ὑπτιούμενος ἐπὶ τὴν κορυφὴν
					ἄκραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					15.11.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph. of
			the appetite (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπτιασμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <i>to be sluggish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρεξιν . . ὑπτιωμένην ἀνεγεῖραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					14.302
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οῦσθαι τὸν στόμαχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.140
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.50
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
